1
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,310
Meet Mango.

2
00:00:03,569 --> 00:00:05,404
Mango notices when you're gone,

3
00:00:05,404 --> 00:00:07,629
and lights up when you come back.

4
00:00:07,888 --> 00:00:08,979
Every day you show up

5
00:00:08,979 --> 00:00:12,470
becomes part of a story you get to keep.

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,762
It starts in three taps.

7
00:00:14,762 --> 00:00:17,432
Choose a friend, give them a name,

8
00:00:17,432 --> 00:00:19,000
pick their temperament.

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,991
No wallet, no sign-up.

10
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,491
Then it's the two of you,

11
00:00:27,491 --> 00:00:29,228
in a room you share.

12
00:00:29,267 --> 00:00:33,930
Feed, play, brush, rest.

13
00:00:34,062 --> 00:00:35,977
Needs fall while you're away,

14
00:00:35,977 --> 00:00:39,689
and Mango's face tells you what's missing.

15
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,937
Every care earns XP

16
00:00:41,937 --> 00:00:44,035
and ticks off today's round.

17
00:00:44,294 --> 00:00:46,082
Say hello, share a dance,

18
00:00:46,082 --> 00:00:47,568
then snap a photo of your room

19
00:00:47,568 --> 00:00:50,281
and send it from your phone.

20
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,984
When you both need a break,

21
00:00:53,984 --> 00:00:55,482
there are four quick games,

22
00:00:55,482 --> 00:00:57,003
and each day brings one round

23
00:00:57,003 --> 00:00:59,205
that everyone shares.

24
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,423
Your profile is your household.

25
00:01:05,682 --> 00:01:07,493
Keep as many pets as you like,

26
00:01:07,493 --> 00:01:08,979
choose who's at home,

27
00:01:08,979 --> 00:01:10,407
dress up and save outfits,

28
00:01:10,407 --> 00:01:14,049
and watch stickers fill in as you care.

29
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:17,578
When you're ready,

30
00:01:17,578 --> 00:01:19,819
keep Mango's story on Solana.

31
00:01:19,819 --> 00:01:22,392
Your wallet app approves once.

32
00:01:22,524 --> 00:01:23,963
That opens a Pawket Wallet

33
00:01:23,963 --> 00:01:25,867
with a little devnet SOL,

34
00:01:25,867 --> 00:01:28,638
and links this phone.

35
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,241
From then on, care is signed right here,

36
00:01:31,241 --> 00:01:32,622
with no pop-ups,

37
00:01:32,622 --> 00:01:34,201
and each moment plays only

38
00:01:34,201 --> 00:01:36,334
after Solana confirms it.

39
00:01:36,465 --> 00:01:38,660
Mango's Passport is public.

40
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:40,552
Visitors can wave once a day,

41
00:01:40,552 --> 00:01:42,038
and Mango's keepsake card

42
00:01:42,038 --> 00:01:44,647
sits in your wallet.

43
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,882
Want a new look?

44
00:01:50,014 --> 00:01:52,092
The Market has hats and halos,

45
00:01:52,092 --> 00:01:54,437
whole rooms, and photo frames.

46
00:01:54,437 --> 00:01:56,175
It's all cosmetic.

47
00:01:56,214 --> 00:02:00,564
Nothing you buy changes care, XP or a score.

48
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,591
This phone can care for your pets,

49
00:02:02,591 --> 00:02:04,677
but it can never move money.

50
00:02:04,936 --> 00:02:08,287
Spending always asks your wallet first.

51
00:02:08,900 --> 00:02:10,464
Want company?

52
00:02:10,723 --> 00:02:13,474
Guilds are optional, and free to join.

53
00:02:13,474 --> 00:02:16,864
Plan a meetup, RSVP, check in,

54
00:02:16,864 --> 00:02:18,591
and vote in a poll.

55
00:02:18,850 --> 00:02:22,828
A guild's optional coin never touches a pet.

56
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,482
Step outside,

57
00:02:24,482 --> 00:02:27,373
and the Park shows every pet kept on Solana,

58
00:02:27,373 --> 00:02:28,801
read live.

59
00:02:28,801 --> 00:02:30,520
Pulse counts it all,

60
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:33,674
straight from the program.

61
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,845
Show up for Mango,

62
00:02:36,845 --> 00:02:38,885
and Mango shows up for you.

63
00:02:39,457 --> 00:02:40,583
One care at a time,

64
00:02:40,583 --> 00:02:43,238
it becomes a story that's yours to keep.

65
00:02:43,277 --> 00:02:44,415
Pawket.

66
00:02:44,415 --> 00:02:46,385
A living companion.
